<title>LATVIA: RIETUMU BANK REP OFFICES IN RUSSIA, KAZAKHSTAN.</title>
<headline>RIETUMU BANK REP OFFICES IN RUSSIA, KAZAKHSTAN.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvta's central bank said on Friday that had given Rietumu Bank, Latvia's fourth largest bank, the green light to open three representative offices abroad, two in Russia and one in Kazakhstan.</p>
<p>The central bank board decided to allow Rietumu to open offices in Moscow, Dnepropetrovsk and the capital of Kazakhstan Alma Ata, a bank spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
